OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder at coastal
OL,4,Acaravan park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal assault at a caravan
OL,8,Fpark.
OL,10,FThe victim, in his 40s, died from
OL,11,Fserious injuries at Valley Farm Holiday
OL,12,FPark in Clacton-on-Sea on Wednesday
OL,13,Fevening, Essex Police said.
OL,15,FDaniel Fox, 39, of Hampden Crescent,
OL,16,FWarley, has been charged with his
OL,17,Fmurder and is due before magistrates in
OL,18,FChelmsford on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
